  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: bbec7a84e96ca95458eba143068d1dd0, type: 3}
  title: Timeflow Examples
  sections:
  - heading: Demo App
    text: Find the main demo in Samples/Scenes/DemoApp
    linkText: Demo App Documentation
    url: https://axongenesis.gitbook.io/timeflow/reference/examples/app-demo
  - heading: Render Pipeline
    text: Timeflow supports all render pipelines and includes example packages for
      both the Universal Render Pipeline (URP) and the High Definition Render Pipeline
      (HDRP). The default included samples use the built-in render pipeline. For
      URP or HDRP please import the included package.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Post Processing
    text: 'If you are using the built-in render pipeline, you will need to import
      Post Processing from the Package Manager, otherwise the related scripts will
      appear as missing and no post processing will be applied. '
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Render Configuration
    text: To use the render settings intended for the Timeflow examples, please locate
      the render pipeline assets and assign them in the Project Settings in the Graphics
      and Quality sections. For HDRP, also assign the HDRP_VolumeProfile in the HDRP
      Default Settings for the default and look dev profiles.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  loadedLayout: 0
  isEditing: 0
